<%- layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

<section class="help-section pt-5 pb-5">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Heading -->
    <div class="text-center mb-4">
      <h2 class="page-title">
        Help <span class="brand-text">Center</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Find answers to your questions and learn how to use our platform
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <div class="faq-section">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h5>How do I book a parking slot?</h5>
        <p>
          Go to the homepage, choose your preferred parking spot, select date & time,
          and click on "Book Now". Complete the payment to confirm your booking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h5>Can I cancel my booking?</h5>
        <p>
          Yes, you can cancel your booking before the start time. Go to your dashboard,
          find your booking, and click on "Cancel Booking".
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h5>Will I get a refund after cancellation?</h5>
        <p>
          Refunds are processed only if cancellation is done before the booking start time.
          The amount will be credited within 5-7 working days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h5>Do I need to create an account?</h5>
        <p>
          Yes, you need to create an account to book parking slots and manage your bookings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h5>What if I face payment issues?</h5>
        <p>
          If your payment fails but money is deducted, it will be refunded automatically.
          You can also contact support for assistance.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Contact Support -->
    <div class="text-center mt-5">
      <p>Still need help?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn teal-main-btn fs-5">
        Contact Support
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>